# Change Log for npgqc-python Project

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).

## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-30

### Added

* ORM for the NPG-QC database schema
* Utilities to retrieve compositions by digest or run, and manual QC
  outcomes by run
